t up structures to act like objects. In addition, in C++ size and memory layout of objects is deterministic."}, {"id": 2, "image": "enpe7n5le01ob05re2img03.jpg", "time": "100000", "text": "<b>Paul</b>: What about other languages?\n</br><b>Roger</b>: C and C++ are way faster than other languages like Python. Another language is Perl. Things are simpler with it as it has only three data types: scalars, arrays, and hashes. However, I don't think you have got to use this language, right?\n</br><b>Paul</b>: I don't think so. Anyway, I've got to go now! My next class starts in 5 minutes. Thanks a lot.\n</br><b>Roger</b>: You're welcome."}], "coverimg": "enpe7n5le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe7n5le01ob05re2aud01"}}], "_data": [], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "type": "audio"}]}]}